   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Avser kostnad f&#xF6;r EKN-premie f&#xF6;r l&#xE5;n som Sri Lankas regering har tagit avseende modernisering och effektivisering av &quot;Old Laxapana Hydropower station&quot;. Utrustningen till kraftverket levererars av ABB Generation AB.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Costs for EKN-premium re. an export credit/loan for Sri Lanka in order to modernise and rehabilitate the Old Laxapana Hydro Power Plant. The new equipment for the power plant will be supplied by ABB Genration AB.</narrative>
